      "content": "but what if there's nothing left to protect? i dont feel like there's a \"me\" worth saving anymore. and walking through the dark with someone just feels exhausting. wouldn't it be easier to just... stop? to just turn the master switch and be done with the searching and the waiting for the darkness to take over?",
